      <abstract>
        <title>Abstract</title>
        <sec>
          <title>Background</title>
          <p>Protein-energy wasting affects up to 50% of patients on hemodialysis <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B1">1</xref>.</p>
        </sec>
        <sec>
          <title>Recommendations</title>
          <p>We recommend 1.0&#8211;1.2 g/kg/day of protein and serum K<sup>+</sup> &#8804; 5.5 mmol/L (<xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B2">2</xref>, <xref ref-type="bibr" rid="B3">3</xref>).</p>
        </sec>
      </abstract>
      <abstract abstract-type="graphical">
        <p><fig id="ga1"><caption><title>Graphical abstract of the guideline.</title></caption><graphic xlink:href="ga1.jpg"/></fig></p>
      </abstract>
      <kwd-group><kwd>hemodialysis</kwd><kwd>nutrition</kwd></kwd-group>
